{'symbol': 'EFX', 'date': '2021-08-07 20:07:00', 'title': 'EQUIFAX ANNOUNCES DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE HEALTH E(FX)', 'text': 'ATLANTA, AUG. 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 EQUIFAX ® (NYSE: EFX) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS SIGNED A DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE HEALTH E(FX)Ⓡ, A LEADING AND EXPERIENCED PROVIDER OF AFFORDABLE CARE ACT (ACA) SERVICES. AS THE LEVEL OF WORKFORCE MANAGEMENT COMPLEXITY INCREASES FOR EMPLOYERS NATIONWIDE, BUSINESSES REQUIRE ROBUST SERVICES TO HELP AUTOMATE AND REDUCE PROCESS FRICTION WITHIN THEIR HR TEAMS.'}